# SHA-256 of the prebuilt archives that fetch-libraries.sh may download
# (from PREBUILT_URL), as "<sha256>  <file>" lines; a download without a
# line here fails with PREBUILT_STRICT=1. There are none now: every
# platform builds its archives itself (build-libraries.sh,
# build-libraries-windows.ps1, which also repackage Spotify's CEF builds,
# checked against cef-sha1sums), and the build copies them from the local
# folder. LiveCode's archives in the prebuilts-v1 release are no longer
# used.
